ECGJev core code release

The files model.py and jevfmt.py under
src/ecgjev/models/decoder/startlux_decision/ are adapted from
StartLuxLabs/StartLux-Decision startlux_decision/model.py and
startlux_decision/jevfmt.py. The upstream inference code is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy is included at:

    src/ecgjev/models/decoder/LICENSE.StartLux-Decision

ECGJev modifications include device placement, detached option-letter
readout weights, a configurable shared-prefix gate, and removal of source
comments and docstrings.

Pretrained model weights are distributed separately under their own terms.
